flowchart TD
    A[Start Application] --> B{User Authenticated?}
    B -->|Yes| C[Load Dashboard]
    B -->|No| D[Show Login Page]
    D --> E[Enter Credentials]
    E --> F{Valid Credentials?}
    F -->|Yes| G{Two-Factor Enabled?}
    F -->|No| H[Show Error Message]
    H --> D
    G -->|Yes| I[Send 2FA Code]
    I --> J[Enter 2FA Code]
    J --> K{Code Valid?}
    K -->|Yes| C
    K -->|No| L{Attempts < 3?}
    L -->|Yes| I
    L -->|No| M[Lock Account]
    M --> N[Send Admin Alert]
    G -->|No| C
    C --> O[Load User Preferences]
    O --> P[Fetch Data from API]
    P --> Q{API Response OK?}
    Q -->|Yes| R[Render Dashboard Widgets]
    Q -->|No| S[Show Cached Data]
    S --> T[Display Stale Warning]
    R --> U[User Interaction]
    T --> U
    U --> V{Action Type}
    V -->|Navigate| W[Load New Page]
    V -->|Submit Form| X[Validate Input]
    V -->|Logout| Y[Clear Session]
    X --> Z{Input Valid?}
    Z -->|Yes| AA[Process Request]
    Z -->|No| AB[Highlight Errors]
    AB --> U
    AA --> AC{Success?}
    AC -->|Yes| AD[Show Confirmation]
    AC -->|No| AE[Show Failure Message]
    AD --> U
    AE --> U
    W --> U
    Y --> D
    N --> END[End]
